# Security & Direct File Access Blocking Rules for Cloudflare Pages

# 1. Block direct browser URL viewing for sensitive markdown, documentation, and configuration files
/sheet.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Status: 404

/README.md
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Status: 404

/generate_icons.py
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Status: 404

/server.js
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  Status: 404

# 2. Block direct URL inspection for internal data directory
/data/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff

# 3. Security headers for all web assets
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
